{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A failed exam, a demon-infested island... and an unhealthy obsession with ice cream.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ann and Onyme just wanted to pass their hero graduation test on a chill island famous for its frozen treats.<br>The mission looked easy: defeat a few demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then they accidentally triggered the apocalypse. Oops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island of Edisap, battle demonic hordes, gather resources, craft gear and potions, and upgrade your equipment to survive the mess you unleashed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with a friend (local or online) in this retro-inspired action-adventure, paying tribute to the classics of the 80s with modern twists and co-op gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise as true heroes?<br>Or be lost forever in <strong>The Ann-Onymity</strong> \u2014<br><i>a place where failed heroes fade into oblivion... cone in hand.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820470?t=1757019421","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3820470?t=1757019421","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820470/888d374884a0d221eb2b2c9a964dd815a975edb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757019421","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820470/888d374884a0d221eb2b2c9a964dd815a975edb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757019421","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A failed exam, a demon-infested island... and an unhealthy obsession with ice cream.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ann and Onyme just wanted to pass their hero graduation test on a chill island famous for its frozen treats.<br>The mission looked easy: defeat a few demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then they accidentally triggered the apocalypse. Oops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the island of Edisap, battle demonic hordes, gather resources, craft gear and potions, and upgrade your equipment to survive the mess you unleashed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with a friend (local or online) in this retro-inspired action-adventure, paying tribute to the classics of the 80s with modern twists and co-op gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise as true heroes?<br>Or be lost forever in <strong>The Ann-Onymity</strong> \u2014<br><i>a place where failed heroes fade into oblivion... cone in hand.</i></p>","developers":["bouletjv"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820470/32a9a025fa7f12eab401f8fc05684382ad671586/header.jpg?t=1757019421","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3820470/194287839/6e2da3dc46b12a0a7383f99e816e7e5ad4a80189/1756326744/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756327838","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3820470/194287839/6e2da3dc46b12a0a7383f99e816e7e5ad4a80189/1756326744/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756327838","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3820470/194287839/6e2da3dc46b12a0a7383f99e816e7e5ad4a80189/1756326744/hls_264_mas